       "measured_effect": "Decode dispatches per token 3387 -> 3099 (-288 = 96 halves x 3). Decode tok/s ABBA means: short prompt 10.69 -> 10.83 (+1.28%), 597-token prompt 9.93 -> 10.60 (+6.69%); second pair alone +0.4% / +3.0% (first unfused arm ran cold, kept).",
