+      "valid_conditions": "Fires only when a GATED_DELTA_NET state src is a single-use GET_ROWS of a recurrent bank and its snapshot tail is SET_ROWS back into the same bank with no other bank access in between (qwen4exp R1 path). Conv-state GET_ROWS/SET_ROWS are not fused. Other graphs never match.",
+      "notes": "lane-299 2026-10-05. Commit subjects 7d07d087b9 / 85f01020b7 still read WIP; HQ rewords at merge."
